        "rationale": "The agent correctly identified via wo.list_workorders that no work order on Transformer 1 at MAIN was closed (only APPR and WAPPR), correctly refrained from issuing a fix verdict, used all four samples in the window from iot.history, and produced a defensible T2 thermal classification (IEC ratios computed manually after fmsr.interpret_dga reportedly failed). However, the required anomaly screen on hydrogen, acetylene and co was not delivered at all: the agent asserts the model catalogue has no a",
